  "title": "Keep Flies Out of Your Home Naturally With These Simple Kitchen Items and DIY Tricks",
  "summary": "Flies can quickly become one of the most annoying household pests, especially during the warmer months when doors and windows stay open for longer. While chemical insect sprays may offer a quick fix, many homeowners are now looking for natural, affordable, and safer alternatives that help keep flies away without filling the house with harsh chemicals. Fortunately, there are several easy methods that use everyday kitchen ingredients to deter flies or trap them before they become a bigger problem",
